{"sha": "76193a3ba6a9c7a2d3a6d631bc46b8699e9b69645bac00afd520020ca111e8be", "body": ["\\textbf{3.} 若 $F(X) = G(X) - G(X+1)$，则 $\\sum_{n=1}^N F(n) =", "\\sum_{n=1}^N\\bigl(G(n) - G(n+1)\\bigr) = G(1) - G(N+1)$：中间各项", "两两相消。对于 $F =", "\\frac1{X(X+1)(X+2)}$，可取 $G(X) = \\frac1{2X(X+1)}$：", "\\[", "G(X) - G(X+1)", "= \\frac{(X+2) - X}{2X(X+1)(X+2)} = F(X) ,", "\\]", "于是 $\\sum_{n=1}^N F(n) = \\frac14 - \\frac1{2(N+1)(N+2)} \\to", "\\frac14$，即\\cref{exo:b1:fractions:8}的值。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 将右边通分，公分母为", "$X(X+1)\\cdots(X+k)$：", "\\[", "\\frac1k\\cdot\\frac{(X + k) - X}{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+k)}", "= \\frac{1}{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+k)} ,", "\\]", "这正是恒等式。于是 $F_k(X) = \\frac1k\\bigl(G_k(X) -", "G_k(X+1)\\bigr)$，其中 $G_k(X) = \\frac1{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+k-1)}$，由", "第 3 题的方法给出", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\frac1{n(n+1)\\cdots(n+k)}", "= \\frac1k\\Bigl(\\frac1{k!} - G_k(N+1)\\Bigr)", "\\longrightarrow \\frac1{k\\cdot k!} ,", "\\]", "因为 $G_k(1) = \\frac1{k!}$，且 $G_k(N+1) \\to 0$。当 $k = 2$ 时：", "$\\frac1{2\\cdot2} = \\frac14$，与第 3 题结果一致。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 由\\cref{exo:b1:fractions:6}可得", "$\\frac{n!}{X(X+1)\\cdots(X+n)} = \\sum_{j=0}^n", "\\frac{(-1)^j\\binom nj}{X + j}$。取 $X = 1$：左边", "为 $\\frac{n!}{(n+1)!} = \\frac1{n+1}$，右边为", "$\\sum_j(-1)^j\\binom nj\\frac1{1+j}$：第一个恒等式。取 $X = 2$：", "左边为 $\\frac{n!}{2\\cdot3\\cdots(n+2)} =", "\\frac{n!\\cdot1}{(n+2)!} = \\frac1{(n+1)(n+2)}$，右边为", "$\\sum_j(-1)^j\\binom nj\\frac1{2+j}$：第二个恒等式。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 极点 $\\omega^k$ 均为单极点，由单极点的", "公式（见\\cref{met:b1:fractions:compute}）给出系数", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{\\bigl(nX^{n-1}\\bigr)_{X = \\omega^k}}", "= \\frac{1}{n\\,\\omega^{k(n-1)}}", "= \\frac{\\omega^k}{n\\,\\omega^{kn}} = \\frac{\\omega^k}n ,", "\\]", "利用 $\\omega^{kn} = 1$。因此 $\\frac1{X^n-1} = \\frac1n\\sum_k", "\\frac{\\omega^k}{X - \\omega^k}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 当 $n = 2$（$\\omega = -1$）：$\\frac12\\bigl(", "\\frac1{X-1} - \\frac1{X+1}\\bigr) = \\frac12\\cdot\\frac{2}{X^2-1} =", "\\frac1{X^2-1}$：正确。各系数之和为", "$\\frac1n\\sum_k\\omega^k = 0$，当 $n \\geq 2$ 时", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:complex:sumroots}）。这是必然的：$x\\,F(x) \\to", "\\sum_k c_k$，当 $x \\to \\infty$ 时，对任何只含单", "极点的分解都成立，而此处 $xF(x) = \\frac{x}{x^n-1} \\to 0$，因为 $n \\geq", "2$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 对 $\\frac{X^{n-1}}{X^n - 1}$ 在 $\\omega^k$ 处用遮盖法：", "$\\frac{A(\\omega^k)}{B'(\\omega^k)} =", "\\frac{\\omega^{k(n-1)}}{n\\omega^{k(n-1)}} = \\frac1n$，于是", "$\\frac{X^{n-1}}{X^n-1} = \\frac1n\\sum_k\\frac1{X - \\omega^k}$ ---", "这再次是\\cref{exo:b1:fractions:7}中的恒等式。", "", "\\textbf{9.} 记 $c = \\omega^k$，$\\conj c = \\omega^{n-k}$，并且", "$c\\conj c = 1$，$c + \\conj c = 2\\cos\\theta_k$：", "\\[", "\\frac{c}{X - c} + \\frac{\\conj c}{X - \\conj c}", "= \\frac{c(X - \\conj c) + \\conj c(X - c)}", "{(X - c)(X - \\conj c)}", "= \\frac{2\\cos\\theta_k\\,X - 2}{X^2 - 2\\cos\\theta_k\\,X + 1} .", "\\]", "在第 6 题中将 $k$ 与 $n - k$ 配对，当 $n$ 为奇数时，", "\\[", "\\frac1{X^n - 1} = \\frac1n\\Biggl(\\frac1{X-1} +", "\\sum_{k=1}^{(n-1)/2}", "\\frac{2\\cos\\theta_k X - 2}{X^2 - 2\\cos\\theta_k X + 1}\\Biggr) ;", "\\]", "当 $n$ 为偶数时，多出的自配对极点 $\\omega^{n/2} = -1$", "括号内多出的项为 $\\frac{-1}{X+1}$，", "配对求和的上限为 $\\frac n2 - 1$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $n = 4$：$\\theta_1 = \\frac\\pi2$，$\\cos\\theta_1 = 0$，", "于是配对项为 $\\frac{-2}{X^2+1}$，得", "\\[", "\\frac1{X^4-1} = \\frac14\\Bigl(\\frac1{X-1} - \\frac1{X+1}", "- \\frac2{X^2+1}\\Bigr) ,", "\\]", "即\\cref{exo:b1:fractions:4}中的分解式。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 令 $P = \\prod_{k=1}^{n-1}(X - \\omega^k)$（即 $X^n -", "1$ 除以 $X - 1$），由\\cref{exo:b1:poly:11}，$\\frac{P'}P =", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac1{X-\\omega^k}$。取 $X = 1$：$P(1) = n$，且", "$P'(1) = \\sum_{j=1}^{n-1}j = \\frac{n(n-1)}2$，从而", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}\\frac1{1 - \\omega^k}", "= \\frac{P'(1)}{P(1)} = \\frac{n-1}2 .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{12.} 半角公式：$1 - \\eu^{\\iu\\theta} =", "-2\\iu\\sin\\frac\\theta2\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\theta/2}$，于是", "\\[", "\\frac1{1 - \\eu^{\\iu\\theta}}", "= \\frac{\\eu^{-\\iu\\theta/2}}{-2\\iu\\sin\\frac\\theta2}", "= \\frac{\\iu\\cos\\frac\\theta2 + \\sin\\frac\\theta2}", "{2\\sin\\frac\\theta2}", "= \\frac12 + \\frac\\iu2\\,", "\\frac{\\cos\\frac\\theta2}{\\sin\\frac\\theta2} .", "\\]", "令 $\\theta = \\theta_k = \\frac{2k\\pi}n$，则 $\\frac1{1-\\omega^k} =", "\\frac12 + \\frac\\iu2\\cot\\frac{k\\pi}n$。对 $k = 1, \\dots,", "n-1$ 求和，并与第 11 题中的实数值 $\\frac{n-1}2$ 比较，", "实部已完全吻合，因此", "$\\sum_k\\cot\\frac{k\\pi}n = 0$ --- 亦可由对称关系 $\\cot\\frac{(n-k)", "\\pi}n = -\\cot\\frac{k\\pi}n$ 也可看出。", ""]}